  "details": "VRChat 2020.3.3, build 992.\nOn entering a world I can rotate objects using keys as intended but if something within the world teleports me or forces me to move in some other way the function stops working.\nI can repeatably demonstrate the bug in the VRChat home world by entering the world picking up a pillow and rotating it normally. If I then interact with a chair to sit down or respawn within the world I can then no longer rotate the pillows. It will no longer function until I reload into the world again.\nThis bug seems to be present across a number of avatars I tried as well",
